## What the company is

Afify works in **software, hardware, and media**. An app, a machine, a film. Same demand on everything that ships.

Thesis: **One product. Many pieces. No center. Built to last.**

Four tests — every product, or it does not ship:

1. **Unified** — one thing you can name. If it needs two names, it is two products.
2. **Modular** — take a piece out, put a better one in. The next idea clicks in.
3. **Decentralized** — no single throat to choke. If one hand can turn it off, it is a hostage.
4. **Sustainable** — used, repaired, kept. If it is designed to be thrown away, it is waste.

